WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.850
Hahahaha! Hahahaha, selfish!

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.820
Hahaha, bossy!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.530
Bossy Village has a giant spiral, too?

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.970
What's going on here?

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.390
Everyone! Fidget, fidget, fret...

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.760
It's the mayor of Rift Village.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.080
What the hell is that?

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.790
Why is there a spiral on our side, too?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.880
Actually, it was Bossy Village 
who first tamed a spiral!

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.250
What?

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.810
Bossy Village got the 
know how for it somewhere

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:36.210
in order to rule surrounding 
villages like us!

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:39.770
And then Selfish Village 
started to fight back...

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.140
So they're both equally bad?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.440
That's stupid.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.590
"A useless race..."

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.840
"A sad marathon, run by two competitors
 who are spitting up blood."

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:50.870
That's what she said.

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.530
It was definitely shorter than that, guru.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.530
And the final result of that was...

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.660
...this?

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:25.980
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.630
<b>Episode 12: Last Period</b>

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:34.630
Arrogant, haughty Bossy Village!

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:38.960
My ultimate spiral will bring down 
a terrible vengeance upon you,

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.090
like none you have ever
 selfishly faced before!

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:43.870
Silence, bossy!

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:49.310
Bossy Village's great spiral will
 show you who's really the #1 boss!

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.040
What's wrong, bossy?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.130
Is this all Selfish Village has?

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.200
This is really dangerous!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.640
The villagers have already
 been evacuated, fret!

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.170
We need to get out of here, too!

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.390
Admit defeat, bossy!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:27.460
The likes of Selfish Village can 
never defeat the proud Bossy Village!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.100
Is that your only selfish attack?

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.240
I'll show you

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.040
that this isn't an ordinary spiral.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.910
This is the ultimate spiral,

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.030
which selfishly turns human
 darkness into power!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.860
Human darkness?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.090
Selfishly crush him!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.250
Choco?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:12.000
So there was something inside that Luluna's
 pendant that could give power to spirals?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.770
Yes.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.360
For some reason, her calls' 
probabilities are all wrong.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.890
They only summon high-level characters.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.440
A natural cheat...

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:28.780
Yes. But of course, that means that countless
 others didn't get the call they wanted.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.790
Frustration, envy, unfairness,

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.250
and endless greed...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.840
Little by little, their darkness 
began to dwell in Luluna's pendant,

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.210
and eventually became an overwhelming power.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.110
I see.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:49.180
Is this a trial that HQ wants 
Haru's group and me to overcome?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.640
No!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:54.180
Luluna was given to me 
for a different reason.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.200
To research her mysteries.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.940
To solve the mystery of her 
messed-up probabilities?

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.160
Yes.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.650
I never thought this would happen.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.700
I hope everyone is okay.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.470
We're just going to have to hurry.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.700
They can't handle this themselves.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.510
Yeah.

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:15.160
Thanks.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.960
Selfishly pound him flat!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.240
This... This can't happen!

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:24.440
A boss like the great
 Bossy Village can't fail!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:26.880
This is all fake! Fake!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.770
Choco? What's wrong?

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.860
Haru... something's coming.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.730
Tell this boss what the hell's going on!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.150
H-How am I supposed to know myself?

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:11.720
It c-combined, guru!

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:15.410
Human greed and despair have fused together!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.770
And the result is trying to devour everything!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.340
So that's...

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.810
...its true form?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.910
Strong... Power...

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.050
Choco!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:41.750
Choco!

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:48.600
It grabbed Choco!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.260
Why?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.680
Ch-Choco!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.590
Don't do it, Haruharu!

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:00.790
It's too dangerous!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:02.130
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.620
But, Choco... Choco!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:18.830
Why am I the only one who never gets one?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.910
It's not fair that everybody else gets one!

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.460
I thought the rate was boosted!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.880
One more roll... Just one more roll...

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.840
They were lying when they 
said there was a 3 percent chance!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.200
If you roll until you get it, 
you've got a 100 percent chance!

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.150
I'll drain my bank account for it!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.680
An unannounced nerf?!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.050
They finished this maintenance 
just to start a new one!

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:42.640
The desire sensor hates me!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.510
A connection error has occurred!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.610
Account deposit error!

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.820
Dem thighs!

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:58.600
This is me!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.620
The darkness of my heart!

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:07.560
Because of my evil feelings,
 Choco... Choco...!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.340
It's not just yours!

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:14.510
This darkness is something 
everyone in the world possesses!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.100
You can't escape these feelings!

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:22.880
But those aren't the
only feelings people have!

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.770
There are brighter ones, guru!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.980
And they can help people, too!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.990
She says the problem with this is 
that it only gathers evil feelings!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.420
Everyone...

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.370
So, Haru, our enemy is...

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.080
him and him alone!

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:43.540
Yeah!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:54.220
Have you grown up a little, Haru?

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.200
I'm glad we made it in time, Brother!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.240
Brother Gilled! Noin!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.390
Gimme free rolls! No!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.940
We're here, too!

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:07.370
Erika-san!

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:08.650
Campanella!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.360
Sorry we're late.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.380
Now, let's go, Haru-kun!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.360
Right!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.570
You guys, too.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.440
R-Right!

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:21.450
Why did we agree to do what she said, guru?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.940
Well, who cares?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:28.540
It's kind of fun to fight 
alongside them, isn't it?

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.750
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.460
Yeah!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.600
Let's go!

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:37.900
Aw, look at those kids...

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.320
Stuff like this always makes me cry.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.760
Is something wrong?

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:50.100
I didn't know that my calls 
would cause this to happen.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.100
I get it! I get it!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.030
It's not your fault!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:59.900
All power depends on the person who uses it.

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:02.240
It's the same with weapons, 
magic, and calls...

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.290
But at least... I want to help everyone!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.980
Then let's make a call together!

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.670
But my calls...

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.590
Don't worry.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:20.530
You only have the power 
to make normal calls left.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:24.180
Can I still save everyone, then?

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.140
Leave it to me!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.720
Lately, I've been on a lucky streak.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.670
If we work together, it'll be fine!

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.230
And...

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.070
And?

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:38.500
If we can't come through for 
them at a time like this,

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.530
then what good are we as call girls?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.950
I'm coming, Choco!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.960
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.120
Choco! Choco!

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:07.620
Why... do you oppose me?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.180
I heard a voice...

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.530
So did we?

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:13.860
Is he talking?

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.440
Give back Choco!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:19.800
Strong power...

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.840
I need it...

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:26.830
To devour everything...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.910
Why did he grab Choco?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:34.290
I'll... protect Choco!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.220
Spirals!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.690
There are so many!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.860
Help Haru!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.770
Make a path for him!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.340
What? They keep coming!

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:28.170
At this rate, Haru will be...

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.890
Choco!

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:37.100
Choco!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:52.760
Nero-san!

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:53.680
Meldia-san!

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.100
And Sly-san, too!

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.470
Iona-san... Luluna-san...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.840
Wow, guru! Look at all those five-stars, guru!

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:11.080
Looks like I got summoned again.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.650
I'll help you, mongrels.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:18.270
But you need to finish this yourself, kid.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:20.860
Thank you!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.070
Then get to work!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.240
If you're too slow, I'll kill you!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.400
Right!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.700
I'm not going to let you pass, obviously.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.880
Wow...

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.600
Hey, stop standing there!

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.360
Crush them all!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.140
Right!

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.780
Choco, I'm coming!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.510
It's too late.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.300
Are those...

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:57.100
...wings?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:02.440
I'll swallow up the whole world!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.990
Wait! Give back Choco!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:14.880
Oh, no!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.330
He'll destroy the world!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:21.620
Choco! Choco!

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.020
What?

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.500
It can't be...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.040
Haru-san, we're back!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.640
I'm glad we made it in time!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.190
Haru!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.400
Don't miss this chance!

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.480
Go, Haru!

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.910
Meme Girl...

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.640
Go save her!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.720
Right!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.320
I won't let everyone's power go to waste!

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.620
Damn you!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.800
<i>Choco, just wait!</i>

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:17.720
<i>We have to stay together 
until I keep my promise!</i>

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.160
<i>So... I'll save you!</i>

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.180
<i>Because we're destined...</i>

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.000
<i>...to change our fate!</i>

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.170
Despair like this...

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:55.430
...is hardly despair at all!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.310
Sorry to keep you waiting, Choco!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:08.930
I waited a long time.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:30.160
Finish it off by giving the order.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.420
M-Me?

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.140
Okay...

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.100
Destroy that spiral!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.140
Right!

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.540
I'm really fretfully sorry!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.660
I never expected this to happen, bosses!

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:54.190
It happened because Selfish Village
 was being so selfish and bossy!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:58.720
What? It was because Bossy Village
 was being so bossy and selfish!

00:16:58.720 --> 00:16:59.710
What, boss?

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.510
You wanna selfishly fight? Fine!

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:06.500
Guys, calm down... Fidget, fidget, fidget...

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:08.280
Sheesh...

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.340
Well, from now on,

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.530
let's all be friends and spend our 
lives cheering on Sapphire-san.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:19.280
Of course, boss. I've always been
 Sapphire-san's bossiest fan!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.560
Yourself, too, Bossy?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.880
Selfish, you, too?

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:29.130
How selfish! You should've just told me.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:30.310
That's right, you boss!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.450
I didn't expect to find 
a comrade so close to me!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.270
What a coincidence!

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.410
You're both fans of Sapphire-san?

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.420
I selfishly didn't realize!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:42.990
Oh, young man. Come selfishly join us!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:46.410
Nobody who likes Sapphire-san 
can be a bad, bossy guy.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.040
What just happened?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.680
It's fine, right? They'll get along now.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.040
Sheesh...

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.730
I'm probably going to be 
talked into being a fan, too.

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:59.180
It might be surprisingly fun.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:09.690
So the Branch Office's zel was never stolen?

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:10.880
Yeah.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:16.520
It was all a trial from HQ to 
train me and the three of you.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:20.040
So Campanella knew about the whole thing?

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.990
That sly woman.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.220
It hurt my heart to do it!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.000
Every week! Really!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.910
You looked pretty happy to me!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.730
She even made her own mask.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.000
Shhh! That's a secret!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:39.050
The chief at HQ said it all worked out great.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:43.900
He said that not only did Haru-kun's group do 
great handling something out of the ordinary,

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.790
so did you, Erika-san!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.400
Really?

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.770
Well, I guess I won't ask questions.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:55.320
But if Branch Office #8 is 
officially rejoining Arc End...

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.940
Will the old periods we
 used to have come back?

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:58.490
Yes?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.880
Which means...

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:04.580
We're back to being at the bottom 
of the totem pole again.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.740
Well, that's fine.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:12.170
Even if we're in the same place, 
we're stronger than we were before!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.130
That's some big talk coming from you, Haru.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:16.970
Really?

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.590
We can finally go home.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.300
Yeah, finally.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.310
What about them?

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.960
Why not go say goodbye?

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:28.770
It's fine.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:33.100
They have their own path.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.780
It's all gone!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.080
<i>"Dear Wiseman,</i>

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.360
<i>I have been forced to shut down.</i>

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.110
<i>Let's meet again someday!"</i>

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:49.110
Jeez... this note is her only goodbye, huh?

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.250
"I'm glad I finished that manga," she says.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.000
We're back to being poor...

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:58.590
Don't worry.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.490
We were always wanderers.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.760
Everything's back to how it was, that's all.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:05.700
Yeah.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.280
I'm sure we'll see everyone again.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:09.140
Yeah, yeah!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.940
Wiseman!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:12.920
Lulululu!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.030
What's wrong?

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.590
Weren't you with Blackpanella?

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.250
Blackpanella told me...

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:27.990
I could go do whatever I wanted.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:30.200
Wiseman...

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.960
Take me... with you!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:36.870
Luluna...

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.320
No?

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.550
It'll be a tough journey, guru.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.770
I know, but...

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.680
I'm sure it'll be fun!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.580
Okay!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.070
Then it's settled!

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.480
Come with us, Lulululu!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.620
Jeez... somebody else to take care of, huh?

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.460
Oh, I forgot.

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.080
What's this?

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.810
Don't worry.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.240
It's just a glass bead.

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.900
I was going to give it to
 you the next time we met.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:19.970
It's no fun having nothing 
on your pendant, right?

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:20.670
Yeah!

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.000
Put it on!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.890
Okay!

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:34.120
All right! Off we go, then!

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:44.420
See you later, Luluna-chan!

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:59.920
"Period." The name given to the ones who 
defeat bizarre monsters called "spirals,"

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.110
and put an end to the sorrowful cycle.

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:24.440
We are periods.

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:27.960
The one hope that can 
end the cycle of despair!

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:33.600
Follow the rest of the story in the game.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:35.740
Choco, what are you talking about?
